{"audio": "matthew-10.opus", "duration_ms": 308398, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 2020, "end_ms": 3360, "text": "Matthew, Chapter Ten."}, {"start_ms": 5100, "end_ms": 14901, "text": "And calling His twelve disciples to Him, Jesus gave them authority over unclean spirits, so that they could drive them out and heal every disease and sickness."}, {"start_ms": 15781, "end_ms": 32962, "text": "These are the names of the twelve apostles: first Simon, called Peter, and his brother Andrew; James son of Zebedee, and his brother John; Philip and Bartholomew; Thomas and Matthew the tax collector; James son of Alphaeus, and Thaddaeus;"}, {"start_ms": 33542, "end_ms": 37282, "text": "Simon the Zealot, and Judas Iscariot, who betrayed Jesus."}, {"start_ms": 38682, "end_ms": 47963, "text": "These twelve Jesus sent out with the following instructions: “Do not go onto the road of the Gentiles or enter any town of the Samaritans."}, {"start_ms": 48643, "end_ms": 50823, "text": "Go rather to the lost sheep of Israel."}, {"start_ms": 51603, "end_ms": 61284, "text": "As you go, preach this message: ‘The kingdom of heaven is near.’ Heal the sick, raise the dead, cleanse the lepers, drive out demons."}, {"start_ms": 61824, "end_ms": 64204, "text": "Freely you have received; freely give."}, {"start_ms": 65164, "end_ms": 68604, "text": "Do not take along any gold or silver or copper in your belts."}, {"start_ms": 69124, "end_ms": 76404, "text": "Take no bag for the road, or second tunic, or sandals, or staff; for the worker is worthy of his provisions."}, {"start_ms": 77505, "end_ms": 83525, "text": "Whatever town or village you enter, find out who is worthy there and stay at his house until you move on."}, {"start_ms": 84285, "end_ms": 86585, "text": "As you enter the home, greet its occupants."}, {"start_ms": 87165, "end_ms": 92905, "text": "If the home is worthy, let your peace rest on it, but if it is not, let your peace return to you."}, {"start_ms": 93785, "end_ms": 100546, "text": "And if anyone will not welcome you or heed your words, shake the dust off your feet when you leave that home or town."}, {"start_ms": 101266, "end_ms": 107566, "text": "Truly I tell you, it will be more bearable for Sodom and Gomorrah on the day of judgment than for that town."}, {"start_ms": 108566, "end_ms": 116047, "text": "Behold, I am sending you out like sheep among wolves; therefore be as shrewd as snakes and as innocent as doves."}, {"start_ms": 116687, "end_ms": 122047, "text": "But beware of men, for they will hand you over to their councils and flog you in their synagogues."}, {"start_ms": 122847, "end_ms": 128868, "text": "On My account you will be brought before governors and kings as witnesses to them and to the Gentiles."}, {"start_ms": 129688, "end_ms": 134068, "text": "But when they hand you over, do not worry about how to respond or what to say."}, {"start_ms": 134548, "end_ms": 136688, "text": "In that hour you will be given what to say."}, {"start_ms": 137348, "end_ms": 141608, "text": "For it will not be you speaking, but the Spirit of your Father speaking through you."}, {"start_ms": 142668, "end_ms": 149909, "text": "Brother will betray brother to death, and a father his child; children will rise against their parents and have them put to death."}, {"start_ms": 150609, "end_ms": 157169, "text": "You will be hated by everyone because of My name, but the one who perseveres to the end will be saved."}, {"start_ms": 157829, "end_ms": 161169, "text": "When they persecute you in one town, flee to the next."}, {"start_ms": 161849, "end_ms": 167130, "text": "Truly I tell you, you will not reach all the towns of Israel before the Son of Man comes."}, {"start_ms": 168250, "end_ms": 172730, "text": "A disciple is not above his teacher, nor a servant above his master."}, {"start_ms": 173510, "end_ms": 177950, "text": "It is enough for a disciple to be like his teacher, and a servant like his master."}, {"start_ms": 178750, "end_ms": 184271, "text": "If the head of the house has been called Beelzebul, how much more the members of his household!"}, {"start_ms": 185331, "end_ms": 186711, "text": "So do not be afraid of them."}, {"start_ms": 187111, "end_ms": 192891, "text": "For there is nothing concealed that will not be disclosed, and nothing hidden that will not be made known."}, {"start_ms": 193751, "end_ms": 199852, "text": "What I tell you in the dark, speak in the daylight; what is whispered in your ear, proclaim from the housetops."}, {"start_ms": 200632, "end_ms": 204512, "text": "Do not be afraid of those who kill the body but cannot kill the soul."}, {"start_ms": 205292, "end_ms": 209512, "text": "Instead, fear the One who can destroy both soul and body in hell."}, {"start_ms": 210192, "end_ms": 212292, "text": "Are not two sparrows sold for a penny?"}, {"start_ms": 212852, "end_ms": 216733, "text": "Yet not one of them will fall to the ground apart from the will of your Father."}, {"start_ms": 217553, "end_ms": 220513, "text": "And even the very hairs of your head are all numbered."}, {"start_ms": 221073, "end_ms": 224913, "text": "So do not be afraid; you are worth more than many sparrows."}, {"start_ms": 226113, "end_ms": 232234, "text": "Therefore everyone who confesses Me before men, I will also confess him before My Father in heaven."}, {"start_ms": 232914, "end_ms": 238174, "text": "But whoever denies Me before men, I will also deny him before My Father in heaven."}, {"start_ms": 239634, "end_ms": 245494, "text": "Do not assume that I have come to bring peace to the earth; I have not come to bring peace, but a sword."}, {"start_ms": 245974, "end_ms": 253695, "text": "For I have come to turn ‘a man against his father, a daughter against her mother, a daughter-in-law against her mother-in-law."}, {"start_ms": 254355, "end_ms": 266936, "text": "A man’s enemies will be the members of his own household.’ Anyone who loves his father or mother more than Me is not worthy of Me; anyone who loves his son or daughter more than Me is not worthy of Me;"}, {"start_ms": 267616, "end_ms": 271836, "text": "and anyone who does not take up his cross and follow Me is not worthy of Me."}, {"start_ms": 272576, "end_ms": 277976, "text": "Whoever finds his life will lose it, and whoever loses his life for My sake will find it."}, {"start_ms": 279116, "end_ms": 284697, "text": "He who receives you receives Me, and he who receives Me receives the One who sent Me."}, {"start_ms": 285497, "end_ms": 295997, "text": "Whoever receives a prophet because he is a prophet will receive a prophet’s reward, and whoever receives a righteous man because he is a righteous man will receive a righteous man’s reward."}, {"start_ms": 296837, "end_ms": 306278, "text": "And if anyone gives even a cup of cold water to one of these little ones because he is My disciple, truly I tell you, he will never lose his reward.”"}], "words": [{"t": "Matthew,", "s": 2020, "e": 2360, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2680, "e": 3020, "si": 0}, {"t": "Ten.", "s": 3120, "e": 3360, "si": 0}, {"t": "And", "s": 5100, "e": 5220, "si": 1}, {"t": "calling", "s": 5300, "e": 5660, "si": 1}, {"t": "His", "s": 5700, "e": 5900, "si": 1}, {"t": "twelve", "s": 6000, "e": 6320, "si": 1}, {"t": "disciples", "s": 6360, "e": 6920, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 6980, "e": 7080, "si": 1}, {"t": "Him,", "s": 7160, "e": 7340, "si": 1}, {"t": "Jesus", "s": 7900, "e": 8360, "si": 1}, {"t": "gave", "s": 8440, "e": 8661, "si": 1}, {"t": "them", "s": 8681, "e": 8821, "si": 1}, {"t": "authority", "s": 8861, "e": 9341, "si": 1}, {"t": "over", "s": 9501, "e": 9701, "si": 1}, {"t": "unclean", "s": 9801, "e": 10281, "si": 1}, {"t": "spirits,", "s": 10361, "e": 10821, "si": 1}, {"t": "so", "s": 11041, "e": 11121, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 11201, "e": 11341, "si": 1}, {"t": "they", "s": 11381, "e": 11501, "si": 1}, {"t": "could", "s": 11561, "e": 11721, "si": 1}, {"t": "drive", "s": 11801, "e": 12141, "si": 1}, {"t": "them", "s": 12161, "e": 12281, "si": 1}, {"t